  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/1"/>We are thankful to You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/2"/>that You Adonoy are our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/3"/>and God of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/4"/>God of all flesh,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/5"/>Our Creator, Creator of the Beginning.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/6"/>Blessings and thanksgivings
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/7"/>to Your great and holy Name
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/8"/>for keeping us alive, and sustaining us;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/9"/>so may You always keep us alive
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/10"/>and sustain us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/11"/>and gather our exiles
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/12"/>to the Courtyards of Your Sanctuary
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/13"/>to observe Your statutes,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/14"/>and to do Your will,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/15"/>and to serve You wholeheartedly,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/16"/>for we are thankful to You.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/17"/>Blessed is the Almighty
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/hodaah/modim_derabbanan/18"/>to Whom all thanks are due.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
